' diagram-type: sequence
@startuml
title v0006-web-ui - configured bootstrap operator + team control request without auth

participant "Web UI / Browser" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "State Registry" as State

UI -> GW : inject / cancel / rerun request\n(no selected team, no operator)
GW -> GW : strip client X-FlowAI-* context\nvalidate configured bootstrap operator + team\ngenerate request_id
alt configured bootstrap operator or team context invalid
  GW --> UI : reject before control request
else valid configured bootstrap operator and team
  GW -> State : POST control record with configured Operator-ID\n(audit attribution only), configured Team-ID,\ndisplay-only Team-Name, Request-ID
  State -> State : authorize task ownership by team_id\nand record canonical audit/control state\nattributed to operator_id + request_id
  State --> GW : accepted or ownership denial
  GW --> UI : status, headers, and body unchanged
end

@enduml
